  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Start Anticipatory Action Plan Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support coordination of partners within the sphere of anticipatory actions such as the anticipation hub for a harmonized implementation. With this grant, the participating organizations and other stakeholders will engage in consultative workshops to use the available forecast with support from the Ministry of water and environment, and office of the prime minister to engage communities timely before hazard onset. Developed plans will monitor available forecast and risk information, pre-agree thresholds for taking action, establish processes based on these thresholds for raising timely alerts, and identify, with communities, appropriate anticipatory actions. During the same consultative meetings, we will find out why some of the districts and their extension staff don&apos;t disseminate information to the persons usually affected so that  context specific means of dissemination are included in the plan.</narrative>
  </description>
